        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Helen West.\rOn the surface she seems like a nice old grandma but below lies a dark secret: She is behing countless deaths through poisoning, brutal murders and whatalike. Her muffins, which she sells all over town, contain parts of  humain brains. In fact, she has build her basement to be an active murder room.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
